<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60840" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠνηγ-έσιον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hunting-establishment, pack
				of hounds</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				10.4
			</span></i>; also, <i>pack of wolves hunting together</i>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύκοι μονοπεῖραι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				594a31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hunt, chase</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸ κ. ἐξιέναι,
				πρὸς τὸ κ. προσιέναι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				6.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπιέναι ἐκ τοῦ κ.</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				26
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.11
			</span></i>: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				224
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				7.45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				3.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				40
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὸ περὶ τὴν Ἀλκιβιάδου ὥραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					309a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακαλεῖσθαί τινα ἐπὶ τὸ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>La.</u>
					194b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνήγιον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2511
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cos</span>), <i><span class="en">
				4157
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Sinope</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>that which is taken in hunting, game</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				6.12
			</span></i>.</div>
